   "text": "You're armed and upright, which makes you the most useful people on this deck. I have six doses of trauma gel. Corin Ashe has burns over a third of his body. Mae Toller took shrapnel under the ribs. Benedikt Sorrow's leg was pinned under a bulkhead for an hour. Without gel, two of them die before your launch craft clears the bay. With all six doses, all three live, and there's nothing left for the people who still have to fight their way out.",
