  "ward_info": {
   "speaker": "varga",
   "text": "Coolant line burst inside it two hours ago. Commander Varr ordered it sealed before the vapour reached triage. The scrubbers in there are failing. Five people. Pell Okafor still answers the intercom.",
   "next": "ward_r"
  },
