   "text": "Good call.",
   "next": "end_node"
  },
  "split_ok": {
   "speaker": "varga",
   "text": "...That's clean work. All three will hold. Take this. One kit, a little reagent. Don't waste it.",
   "next": "end_node"
  },
  "split_fail": {
   "speaker": "varga",
   "text": "No, no — you're tearing the packing. Move. I'll save the two I can. Benedikt... I'm sorry. Get out of my way.",
   "next": "end_node"
  },
  "took": {
   "speaker": "varga",
   "text": "There it is: the mathematics. Fine. I'll keep Mae alive with what's left. Don't come back here for absolution.",
   "next": "react_took"
